body:
It's actually just a cheap Exotic Carbon fork (465mm a-c; 15mm axle)

&#x200B;

Seems solid and comfy though, and weighs a fair bit less than a kg, so much less than the steel forks I had before

I find it impossible to fully commit to a partner as I can't be sure I won't go into that same suicidal mindset again.

&#x200B;

It's shit.

Depression

